Subject: Set StartupWMClass in ark's desktop entry to its desktop id, org.kde.ark

Plasma's task manager matches a window to a desktop entry by its Wayland
app_id, which KAboutData sets to the desktop file name, org.kde.ark, and
by StartupWMClass. Upstream's StartupWMClass=ark names neither, so the two
lookups disagree.

--- a/app/org.kde.ark.desktop.cmake
+++ b/app/org.kde.ark.desktop.cmake
@@ -160,7 +160,7 @@
 Type=Application
 Categories=Qt;KDE;Utility;Archiving;Compression;X-KDE-Utilities-File;
 InitialPreference=3
-StartupWMClass=ark
+StartupWMClass=org.kde.ark
 Comment=Work with file archives
 Comment[ar]=العمل مع أرشيفات الملفات
 Comment[ast]=Funciona con archivos
